<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Soufflet barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Soufflet barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday accepted Soufflet France's tender for 25,000 tonnes of feed barley at $142.44 per tonne C&amp;F.</p>
<p>A statement from the grain commission said the shipment would be delivered through Limassol port.</p>
</text>
